" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[666,162][888,306]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /></node><node index="3" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[888,162][1032,306]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="更多对话操作" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[924,198][996,270]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[900,174][1020,294]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /></node><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,354][1032,1737]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,354][1032,1560]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]"><node index="0" text="Start with reliable monthly take-home income. List essentials first: housing, utilities, groceries, transport, insurance, minimum debt payments, and any support obligations. Then set practical limits for flexible spending such as dining out, shopping, and entertainment. A needs/wants/savings split can be a useful starting point, but adapt it to your actual costs and priorities rather than forcing a fixed formula.&#10;&#10;Plan for savings as a regular expense. Schedule an automatic transfer after payday, even if the amount is modest, and increase it when your income rises or costs fall. Keep short-term emergency savings somewhere safe and accessible, separate from everyday spending. First aim for a starter cushion that could cover a common surprise, then work toward several months of essential expenses. Choose a target that reflects job stability, health needs, dependents, and how quickly you could replace your income.&#10;&#10;If you carry high-interest debt, compare the cost of that debt with the value of building a cash buffer. Keep enough savings to avoid relying on new borrowing for a minor emergency, while directing additional funds toward expensive balances. Continue making required payments and avoid treating investments or credit limits as emergency cash.&#10;&#10;Set aside money monthly for predictable but irregular costs—annual premiums, medical expenses, travel, gifts, repairs, or replacing a laptop. These are not emergencies; separate savings goals help keep them from disrupting your plan. Review subscriptions and recurring bills periodically, but focus on changes you can sustain.&#10;&#10;Track spending for a few weeks, then compare actual results with your plan. Review weekly without judging yourself; adjust categories when reality differs from estimates. At month-end, note what worked, what felt too restrictive, and one change to try next month. Leave room for enjoyment. Revisit the budget after a move, job change, pay increase, or major new goal. A useful budget is flexible, repeatable, and built around the life you want—not a test of perfection." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,354][996,1524]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1590][1032,1737]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]"><node index="0" text="✓ 回答已结束 · 本轮未执行记账" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,1632][614,1683]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /><node index="1" text="会话已回归待命就绪状态。本轮仅提供信息解答，未向账本写入任何记录。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,1701][990,1737]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]" /></node></node><node index="5" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[48,1761][1032,1905]" xpos="[0,0][0,0]"><node index="0" text="有新消息，跳到最新" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.yansuu1.jizhang" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="f